n bent  on hardline religious fundamentalism  remember that while there are definitely  supporters of that ideology there's a  whole other side to this country that we  rarely see most Iranian czar normal  people living normal lives they want to  connect they want to feel safe and they  want peace as much as you and I do  that's something I think we could afford  to talk about a little bit more  [Music]

